  "details": "Gonna put this first: I don't know if this error was Udon or Unity, so I'm reporting it to both.\n\"selector_thread_wakeup_drain_pipes: recv () failed, error (10054)\"\nThis error message began spamming Unity's Editor.log file inflating it's size to 645.4GB on my C drive.\nThis issue happened after leaving Unity 2018.4.14f1 open with SDK3 and Udon for a few days. I had a node graph open and the editor was not in play mode.\nI've had left other versions of Unity and VRCSDKs open for more than a few days before with no issues.\nHere is a snippet of the Editor.log when the spam started: https://pastebin.com/ZshshNY4\nUnity: 2018.4.14f1\nSDK: UDONSDK-2019.12.22.12.32_Public\nUdon: VRCSDK3-2019.12.21.16.01",
